{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おつかわたん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/08/11/8918830/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいコメントありがとう(;_;)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/08/11/8918830/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったです。わたしの支え。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなめろさん大すき...♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも陽菜を宜しくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>>"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっという間に八月。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づかなかった(°＿°)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"八月は全国ツアーやね。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/08/11/8918830/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来る人ー？(挙手)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わくわく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/08/11/8918830/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近みた映画。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・アメイジング・トイワールド"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ヘイフラワーとキルトシュー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏休みなので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"子供のお話選んでみた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アメイジング・トイワールドは学校の謎を生徒が謎解くお話。凄くわくわくしちゃう作品。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘイフラワーとキルトシューは、ヘイフラワーとキルトシューが本当に天使。目にうつる全てが可愛いに溢れてる。ハピネスな気持ちになれる♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちもお勧め"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/08/11/8918830/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前にお勧めの映画をブログでひなめろさんに聞いたときに答えて下さった作品は、ほぼ全部チェックして見たよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/08/11/8918830/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/08/11/8918830/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また何かお勧め作品"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったら教えて下さい..(°＿°)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハッピーになれる作品がすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/08/11/8918830/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、でも告白とか乾き系もすき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/08/11/8918830/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、ディズニーに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3時間だけ行ってました(｡･д･｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/08/11/8918830/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学時代の友達と2人で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お昼に電話してたら会いたくなって急遽！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジェラトーニを買いたいって理由で(｡･д･｡)ﾉﾞ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと買えた！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいグッズでたらいいなー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アトラクションは、めっちゃ空いてたからいっぱいのれたー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ暴風が(｡･д･｡)ww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/08/11/8918830/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮った写真みんな顔が髪の毛でうつりませんでした(｡･д･｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったからよかったけど♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>>"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MARQUEE発売されました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後が単独グラビアとか貴重です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不思議の国の川後Pです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後Pがオーディションから今までをP目線で語りました。色んな事を取材で語らせてもらいました。字がびっしり載っててきっと充実してる内容だと思うので是非。川後だけやなくって、今までセンターやった子とか柳沢監督とか乃木ファンなら買うしか！な感じの内容なので♡♡あと、色んなアイドルさん載ってるんだけど一緒に載ってるアイドルさんがびっくり。夢の共演(意味深)。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陽菜得すぎる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/08/11/8918830/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/08/11/8918830/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにひなのグラビアの服は自前！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アリスっぽい服やったやろ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/08/11/8918830/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後Pってのを色んな方に最近知ってもらってPとしての仕事とかを頂くようになってて凄く有難い。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見たら感想まってるね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/08/11/8918830/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/08/11/8918830/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【質問】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなアイスの味は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい。ばいぴょん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーんなの心に魔法をかけちゃうぞ？"}],"source":"archive"}